content:
Doresain is my favourite awakener so I tried to build my lineup around learning to play with him and just got lucky with my pulls, but I was wondering whether my comp is wrong after all… it felt strange not having more healing or death resistance, but Salvador at least was providing some considerable healing and shielding through the furnace;
I was questioning whether I have enough sustain and should be bringing Faint for counter and resistance, or whether I genuinely need more healing, but then I would probably be losing huge damage or utility by dropping Saya or Thais? 
Should I probably just wait until I’m a higher level and specialize the builds more to see whether the issue works itself out?
